  "disclosures": [
    {
      "id": "d1",
      "from": 2,
      "to": 2,
      "text": "本书出场角色均已满18岁，不存在任何未成年人。",
      "channel": "author",
      "mode": "assertion",
      "holder": null,
      "about": [
        "Book",
        "Characters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d2",
      "from": 18,
      "to": 18,
      "text": "这副身体的原主人名叫苏天晴；这个世界与自己曾经的世界相差无几，但人类与兽人共存。",
      "channel": "narrator",
      "mode": "assertion",
      "holder": null,
      "about": [
        "OriginalOwner",
        "Human",
        "Orc",
        "Body"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d3",
      "from": 19,
      "to": 19,
      "text": "这里的兽人指猫娘狐娘，不是从地里长出来的大菌子绿皮。",
      "channel": "narrator",
      "mode": "assertion",
      "holder": null,
      "about": [
        "Orc"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d4",
      "from": 20,
      "to": 20,
      "text": "兽人数量远不及人类；原主苏天晴自幼孤独长大、社恐孤僻，靠兽人互助协会资助考上蓉城最好的医学院，却在临近开学时感染兽人流感，熬夜时突发暴发性心肌炎。",
      "channel": "narrator",
      "mode": "assertion",
      "holder": null,
      "about": [
        "Orc",
        "Human",
        "OriginalOwner",
        "OrcAidAssociation",
        "MedicalCollege",
        "Rongcheng",
        "OrcFlu",
        "FulminantMyocarditis"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d5",
      "from": 21,
      "to": 21,
      "text": "原主的死法和自己一模一样。",
      "channel": "thought",
      "mode": "assertion",
      "holder": "SuTianqing",
      "about": [
        "OriginalOwner"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d6",
      "from": 8,
      "to": 9,
      "text": "抛开听起来离谱的反派魔法少女身份不谈，这副身体的模样绝妙，每个细节都满足自己曾经的幻想，让人想细细品尝。",
      "channel": "thought",
      "mode": "assertion",
      "holder": "SuTianqing",
      "about": [
        "VillainMagicalGirl",
        "Body",
        "SuTianqing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d7",
      "from": 12,
      "to": 14,
      "text": "美妙；自己太可爱了，无论面庞还是身材都与曾经想象的完美匹配；萝莉本身就是最美妙的奖励。",
      "channel": "thought",
      "mode": "assertion",
      "holder": "SuTianqing",
      "about": [
        "SuTianqing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d8",
      "from": 15,
      "to": 15,
      "text": "嘿嘿嘿，可爱的小狐狸。",
      "channel": "thought",
      "mode": "assertion",
      "holder": "SuTianqing",
      "about": [
        "SuTianqing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d9",
      "from": 26,
      "to": 26,
      "text": "“……喂？小破书你在吗？”",
      "channel": "speech",
      "mode": "question",
      "holder": "SuTianqing",
      "about": [
        "GuShu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d10",
      "from": 29,
      "to": 29,
      "text": "该不会所谓的反派魔法少女根本就不存在吧？",
      "channel": "thought",
      "mode": "question",
      "holder": "SuTianqing",
      "about": [
        "VillainMagicalGirl"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d11",
      "from": 35,
      "to": 35,
      "text": "“好疼！……鼻血！鼻血冒出来了啊啊啊啊！”",
      "channel": "speech",
      "mode": "assertion",
      "holder": "SuTianqing",
      "about": [
        "SuTianqing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d12",
      "from": 38,
      "to": 38,
      "text": "【守护之星激活】",
      "channel": "voice",
      "mode": "assertion",
      "holder": "MysteriousVoice",
      "about": [
        "GuardianStar"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d13",
      "from": 39,
      "to": 39,
      "text": "【秘典序章已完成，开启每日任务】",
      "channel": "voice",
      "mode": "assertion",
      "holder": "MysteriousVoice",
      "about": [
        "GuShu",
        "DailyTask"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d14",
      "from": 40,
      "to": 40,
      "text": "每日任务？守护之星？好家伙你来真的。",
      "channel": "thought",
      "mode": "question",
      "holder": "SuTianqing",
      "about": [
        "DailyTask",
        "GuardianStar",
        "MysteriousVoice"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d15",
      "from": 42,
      "to": 42,
      "text": "这枚金色十字星材质不明、做工精致、手感扎实，不像塑料玩具，应该就是魔法少女们必备的变身道具。",
      "channel": "thought",
      "mode": "conjecture",
      "holder": "SuTianqing",
      "about": [
        "GuardianStar",
        "MagicalGirl"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d16",
      "from": 43,
      "to": 43,
      "text": "可这所谓的每日任务……要怎么查看呢？",
      "channel": "thought",
      "mode": "question",
      "holder": "SuTianqing",
      "about": [
        "DailyTask"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d17",
      "from": 44,
      "to": 44,
      "text": "像前世网络小说那样心里默念“系统！”，还是有什么特别的解锁密码？",
      "channel": "thought",
      "mode": "question",
      "holder": "SuTianqing",
      "about": [
        "System"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d18",
      "from": 46,
      "to": 46,
      "text": "比起那个莫名其妙的秘典，苏天晴对这枚所谓的“守护之星”更感兴趣。",
      "channel": "thought",
      "mode": "assertion",
      "holder": "SuTianqing",
      "about": [
        "GuShu",
        "GuardianStar",
        "SuTianqing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d19",
      "from": 47,
      "to": 47,
      "text": "魔法少女变身！穿着华丽的洋装在城市间穿梭飞行与怪人战斗！这具身体的原主人也曾经梦想过这种场面！",
      "channel": "thought",
      "mode": "assertion",
      "holder": "SuTianqing",
      "about": [
        "MagicalGirl",
        "OriginalOwner",
        "Body"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d20",
      "from": 48,
      "to": 48,
      "text": "要试试看吗？",
      "channel": "thought",
      "mode": "question",
      "holder": "SuTianqing",
      "about": [
        "SuTianqing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d21",
      "from": 49,
      "to": 57,
      "text": "“变……变身！”“魔法少女变身！”“henshin！”“光啊！”“盖亚！！”",
      "channel": "speech",
      "mode": "request",
      "holder": "SuTianqing",
      "about": [
        "GuardianStar",
        "MagicalGirl"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d22",
      "from": 52,
      "to": 52,
      "text": "嗯？不对吗？变身不是这么喊的？还是说要加点什么前缀？",
      "channel": "thought",
      "mode": "question",
      "holder": "SuTianqing",
      "about": [
        "MagicalGirl"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d23",
      "from": 58,
      "to": 58,
      "text": "这秘典都不给新手指引，别人拿到系统多少有新手任务，至少教我怎么变身。",
      "channel": "thought",
      "mode": "assertion",
      "holder": "SuTianqing",
      "about": [
        "GuShu",
        "System",
        "DailyTask"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d24",
      "from": 59,
      "to": 59,
      "text": "破玩意！没意思！",
      "channel": "thought",
      "mode": "denial",
      "holder": "SuTianqing",
      "about": [
        "GuardianStar",
        "GuShu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d25",
      "from": 61,
      "to": 61,
      "text": "也没见这上面有写字呀，到底要怎么才能变身呢。",
      "channel": "thought",
      "mode": "question",
      "holder": "SuTianqing",
      "about": [
        "GuardianStar"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d26",
      "from": 66,
      "to": 66,
      "text": "【初次变身，已完成】",
      "channel": "voice",
      "mode": "assertion",
      "holder": "MysteriousVoice",
      "about": [
        "SuTianqing",
        "GuardianStar"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d27",
      "from": 67,
      "to": 67,
      "text": "“什、什么东西！？”",
      "channel": "speech",
      "mode": "question",
      "holder": "SuTianqing",
      "about": []
    },
    {
      "id": "d28",
      "from": 68,
      "to": 68,
      "text": "原来是触摸屏的吗！我还以为是声控呢！",
      "channel": "thought",
      "mode": "assertion",
      "holder": "SuTianqing",
      "about": [
        "GuardianStar"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d29",
      "from": 70,
      "to": 72,
      "text": "有那么一瞬间，苏天晴想抱着自己狂舔；除了可爱，依然是可爱。",
      "channel": "thought",
      "mode": "assertion",
      "holder": "SuTianqing",
      "about": [
        "SuTianqing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d30",
      "from": 74,
      "to": 74,
